{
  "_comment": "Shared marker corpus, read by internal/clarify (Go) and ui/src/Clarify.test.tsx (TS). The two parsers are deliberately duplicated (F-0175); this corpus is the lock that keeps them in step (F-0182). Every case lists ALL markers Parse/markerSpans must return, with exact raw+offset+resolved. offsets are BYTE offsets in Go and UTF-16 code-unit offsets in TS — keep marker bodies ASCII below so both agree.",
  "cases": [
